The '''Bingolibur''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sword]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Bingolibur''' may be offered when talking to {{NPCSprite|Bingo}} on a [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profile after completing a set number of goals.

