== Trivia ==
*The '''Bingolibur''' is a reference to the [[w:excalibur|Excalibur]], the legendary sword of [[w:King Arthur|King Arthur]].
*The '''Bingolibur'''{{'}}s {{stat|mf}} bonus worked with the {{Item|Golden Dragon Pet}}'s {{AN|Dragon's Greed}} ability before it was removed.
*As it is {{Soulbound}}, the '''Bingolibur''' cannot be transferred from a {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profile to any other profile.

